	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Aquamirae adds a frozen-ocean region called the Ice Maze and a haunted Ship Graveyard beneath it. Search newly generated cold ocean territory and treat unusual ice formations as an expedition boundary."
				"Bring boats, doors, blocks, Water Breathing, Night Vision and a marked route back to open water. Ice makes surface travel fast until cracks, walls and enemies separate the group."
				"Mark a shore camp before descending. The safest return from the graveyard is the one prepared while everyone can still see the sky."
				"Aquamirae's Ice Maze and Ship Graveyard turn frozen oceans into a staged expedition of hostile sailors, deep water, ice corridors, and rare equipment. Scout the surface before committing to a descent."
			]
			id: "684F93A21FD9659A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "00D5BEEBDAA0A832"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
