			description: [
				"The Ice Maze contains its own plants, animals and points of interest. High walls and repeated shapes can hide how far the team has travelled."
				"Use map markers and a consistent torch or banner language that remains visible against snow. Avoid placing hundreds of random lights that make every corridor look explored."
				"Search for structures and clues rather than mining straight through every wall. Aquamirae's atmosphere is part of its progression."
				"Aquamirae's Ice Maze and Ship Graveyard turn frozen oceans into a staged expedition of hostile sailors, deep water, ice corridors, and rare equipment. Scout the surface before committing to a descent."
