		{
			dependencies: ["684F93A21FD9659A"]
			description: [
				"Beneath the ice lies the Ship Graveyard, with wreckage, shelters and hostile life at different depths. Plan air, visibility and inventory space before leaving the surface camp."
				"Search each wreck methodically and mark completed sections. Water currents, darkness and vertical distance can make a familiar coordinate difficult to reach twice."
				"Keep lore items and unique equipment together for later study. The graveyard tells one connected story more clearly when its evidence is not scattered through personal backpacks."
				"Aquamirae's Ice Maze and Ship Graveyard turn frozen oceans into a staged expedition of hostile sailors, deep water, ice corridors, and rare equipment. Scout the surface before committing to a descent."
