			description: [
				"Captain Cornelia is Aquamirae's central boss encounter. Gather the mod's clues and prepare underwater movement, recovery supplies and a group plan before triggering the fight."
				"Watch the arena and attack pattern before committing every player to melee. Keep one clear route for regrouping and do not carry the entire expedition archive into the boss room."
