		{
			dependencies: ["5ADFE613EF598838"]
			description: [
				"Aquaculture expands fishing with modular rods, hooks, bait and many biome-dependent fish. Use JEI to inspect what each tackle component changes before crafting the most expensive option."
				"Prepare a Tackle Box and keep spare line or hooks. Fish from several biomes and conditions rather than expecting one dock to reveal the whole mod."
				"Cook common catches, display memorable ones and keep a written record of where rare species were found. Fishing becomes exploration when place matters."
				"Abyssal and Aquaculture creatures may share the same waters while belonging to different systems. Use Jade to identify them, then consult JEI or the relevant guide before deciding what to catch, fight, or preserve."
