			description: [
				"Lockboxes and treasure chests add excitement to ordinary fishing. Open them safely and remember that Lootr-style individual structure chests are a different system."
				"Neptune's Bounty leads to Neptunium, Aquaculture's rare material. Improve the fishing setup and keep fishing varied; do not assume ten empty casts mean the feature is broken."
