			description: [
				"Unusual Fish and DragN's Bettas expand aquatic variety, while Better Fish Tanks, fish plaques and display blocks provide ways to exhibit discoveries."
				"Separate compatible species and follow each mod's capture or tank rules. A decorative glass box is not automatically a functioning habitat."
				"Label each display with species, mod and discovery location. Leave room for future finds so the aquarium grows as a record rather than a storage overflow."
				"Better Fish Tanks turns aquatic collection into husbandry and display. Build the enclosure first, verify water and space, and move one specimen at a time instead of carrying an entire expedition's living cargo loose."
